.TH SAMEDAYDESK 1 "" "samedaydesk 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.\" Generated from the command manifest; do not edit.
.SH NAME
samedaydesk \- SameDayDesk agent CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B samedaydesk
\fIcommand\fR [\fI\-\-flag value\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Noninteractive CLI for agents. One JSON envelope on stdout (samedaydesk.cli.result.v1 or samedaydesk.cli.error.v1), JSONL (samedaydesk.cli.stream.v1) when streaming, one diagnostic line on stderr on failure. No prompts. Secret\-named flags are refused. A tenant credential is read only from an existing 0600 \-\-credential\-file or the first line of stdin (\-\-credential\-stdin), is bound to the run's origin and the gateway path, and is never printed or forwarded across origins or redirects.
